   "no": 3,
   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>这套流程的数据主体由物理模型生成，<strong>人工标注只在两处</strong>：用历史测试井校准产能比模型，用出砂井反推风险阈值。真正要花功夫的是岩石力学参数——强度取错 10 MPa，风险指数就整体偏移一大截。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>储层与岩石力学参数</span><span class='cl-s'>强度、应力、渗透率</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，测井 + 岩心标定</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>射孔参数与产能</span><span class='cl-s'>孔密、相位、穿深、测试产量</span></span><span class='cl-n'>200—500 井次，校准代理模型</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>出砂与作业反馈</span><span class='cl-s'>出砂量、检泵与措施记录</span></span><span class='cl-n'>反推风险指数阈值</span></div></div>"
